{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21815","headline":"有酒十章 九 · 元稹","name":"有酒十章 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒有酒兮日将落，余光委照在林薄。\n阳乌撩乱兮屋上栖，阴怪跳趫兮水中跃。\n月争光兮星又繁，烧横空兮焰仍烁。\n我可奈何兮时既昏，一杯又进兮聊处廓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}